    ((Fl.ofF64 x).toRat.2 * 2^52) (Fl.ofF64 x).signbit) =
      (Fl.roundRat (Fl.ofF64 x).toRat.1 (Fl.ofF64 x).toRat.2 (Fl.ofF64 x).signbit : Fl double) at hr
  rw [SmallExact.roundRat_toRat SmallExact.good_double _ hx'] at hr
