zero, selected complex, conversion, or non-Bool negation can run.  The
descriptor's intrinsic concrete bit does not override the actual query.
Invariant: base/complex.jl:1155-1160. -/
def ComplexArrayFalsePredicate : Prop :=
  ∀ (E State Tag Array NotBool : Type) (Value : Tag → Type)
      (ops : ArrayComplexOps (RootM E State) Tag Value Array NotBool)
      (element : ArrayElementType Tag) (array : Array) (state : State),
    let selected := { ops with isConcrete := fun _ => pure (.boolean false) }
